---
---

<section class="py-16 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-slate-950 tracking-tight mb-3">Not Ready to Book a Call Yet? Start Here.</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-500 mb-6">Download a free guide that shows you where most car washes are losing money—and how to fix it.</p>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 bg-slate-50">
        <div class="font-black text-slate-900 mb-2">5 Hidden Costs Killing Your Car Wash Profits</div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">Most operators lose thousands monthly without realizing it. This guide breaks down the most common cost leaks and how to identify them.</p>
        <ul class="text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-2">
          <li>• The #1 chemical cost leak most operators miss</li>
          <li>• Why equipment downtime is costing more than you think</li>
          <li>• Simple fixes that improve profitability within weeks</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <form data-form="guide" class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-4">
      <div>
        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Your Name <span class="text-red-400">*</span></label>
        <input name="name" type="text" required placeholder="John Smith" class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500/30" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Email Address <span class="text-red-400">*</span></label>
        <input name="email" type="email" required placeholder="you@company.com" class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500/30" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Company Name <span class="text-slate-400 font-normal">(optional)</span></label>
        <input name="company" type="text" placeholder="Your Car Wash Name" class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500/30" />
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-[#0779ef] hover:bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors">Send Me the Guide</button>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 text-center">No spam • Just actionable insights</p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
